\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  My Master and my good Saviour,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Most gracious and deliverer.
\par My sins are very numerous
\par And thus my soul is in pain.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj My sins are many and like swords,
\par Have pierced my heart and have got stucked
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Have mercy on me, O, God.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Remember me and take my heavy
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj burdensome sins away.
\par because you went through pain and struggled
\par on the cross for my sake.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj My sins would have made me so sad
\par and drowned me then outright in it
\par and in death everlasting.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Because you gave me that promise
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 I shall wait for your mercy
\par It brings to me a good comfort
\par and would let my pains subside
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par because it tells us of the mercies
\par that you gave to all who come
\par to you with true repentance.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  I kneel before you O my God
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 with my soul and broken heart.
\par Out from my heart I pray to you,
\par have mercy on a poor soul.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par My sins that I cannot devoid
\par Forgive me through your mighty grace,
\par Treat me not as I deserve.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Give me the strength through your spirit
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 that I may walk on your way.
\par My Saviour let me stay with you
\par until my last day on earth.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let me come to your glory through
\par a happy and a peaceful death
\par and give you thanks forever.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

